MONTHLY CLIMATOLOGICAL SUMMARY for <%= report.month_name %> <%= report.year %>

MONTHLY STATISTICS:
  Mean Temperature:     <%= report.formatted_temp(report.month_mean_temp) %>°F
  High Temperature:     <%= report.formatted_temp(report.month_high_temp) %>°F (Day <%= report.month_high_temp_day || 'N/A' %>)
  Low Temperature:      <%= report.formatted_temp(report.month_low_temp) %>°F (Day <%= report.month_low_temp_day || 'N/A' %>)
  Heat Degree Days:     <%= report.formatted_degree_days(report.total_heat_degree_days) %>
  Cool Degree Days:     <%= report.formatted_degree_days(report.total_cool_degree_days) %>
  Total Precipitation:  <%= report.formatted_rain(report.total_rain) %> in
  Mean Pressure:        <%= report.formatted_pressure(report.month_mean_pressure) %> hPa
  High Pressure:        <%= report.formatted_pressure(report.month_high_pressure) %> hPa (Day <%= report.month_high_pressure_day || 'N/A' %>)
  Low Pressure:         <%= report.formatted_pressure(report.month_low_pressure) %> hPa (Day <%= report.month_low_pressure_day || 'N/A' %>)
  Avg Wind Speed:       <%= report.formatted_wind_speed(report.avg_wind_speed) %> mph
  High Wind Speed:      <%= report.formatted_wind_speed(report.month_high_wind_speed) %> mph (Day <%= report.month_high_wind_day || 'N/A' %>)
  Dominant Wind Dir:    <%= report.formatted_dominant_wind %>

                    TEMPERATURE (°F), RAIN (in), PRESSURE (hPa), WIND SPEED (mph)

                                              HEAT   COOL          MEAN   HIGH   LOW           AVG
DAY   MEAN   HIGH  TIME    LOW  TIME    DEG    DEG   RAIN   PRES   PRES   TIME   PRES   TIME   WIND   HIGH  TIME    DOM DIR
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
<% entries_by_day = report.entries.select { |e| e.hour.nil? }.index_by(&:day) -%>
<% (1..report.days_in_month).each do |day| -%>
<% entry = entries_by_day[day] -%>
<%= format_text_row(day, entry, report) %>
<% end -%>
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Notes:
- Times shown in 24-hour format (HH:MM) America/Los_Angeles timezone
- Days with no data shown as "N/A"
<% if has_partial_days?(report) -%>
- * Indicates partial day (incomplete measurements)
<% end -%>
<% if generation_time -%>
- Report generated in <%= generation_time %> seconds
<% end -%>
